msgctxt "96"
msgid ""
"Well, how was it!? That bone marrow extract just about kicks ya in the "
"teeth, but then the pig skin comes in to soften and sweeten the blow! It's a"
" fighting-fit tonkotsu for sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"Not to mention, the broth's so darn good, you could drink it to the very "
"last drop and still want a whole 'nother cup! So whaddya think? Worthy of "
"the Kyushu No. 1 Star name!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "...Well, I'll be darned. That was actually pretty good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"First thing I noticed was the bone marrow. Goes down smooth like gravy on a "
"waterslide. I gotta say, wrapping it in pig skin collagen was the right "
"choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"And those thin noodles... Mmph! Absolutely brilliant. Tastes right at home "
"with the broth. I noticed you put a few other goodies in there that balance "
"out the flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"And as you said, I could drink it to the very last drop...\r\n"
"Now this is the rich tonkotsu that put us on the map!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"It's amazing you could condense all these complex flavors into a cup of "
"instant noodles. Nice work figuring all that out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Well, it quickly became obvious that I couldn't just use your recipe. There "
"was always something missing, it seemed, so I had to think outside the "
"broth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"So I focused on methods unique to my industry in order to really pick apart "
"the magic of how it's made."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"See, in order to bring out that rich tonkotsu flavor, I had to crush the "
"pork bone⑬and I mean pulverize it. Otherwise the collagen wouldn't leak out "
"into the soup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever you did, you got the flavor down pat. This is the kind of "
"noodle I'd be proud to put my logo on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Then... does that mean my creation... passes the test?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"I'd say... it passes with flying colors. You may use the\r\n"
"Kyushu No. 1 Star branding with my full support."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Yeeeeessssss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Now I can eat Kyushu No. 1 Star ramen whenever and wherever\r\n"
"I want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Wait a minute, young man. You mean to tell me this was all\r\n"
"just so you could eat my ramen any time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Hahaha... Well, that was a big part of it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "So, your tonkotsu finally made the grade. Good thing you kept at it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Well, if it wasn't for you... it never woulda happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"I really oughta thank you. I mean, who else woulda thought to use sweet, "
"succulent pig skin from Okinawa? And the way you crushed those thugs... It "
"was pure artistry at work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Now I'd like to find some way to thank you, mister... Ah, I never caught "
"your name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "It's Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr "Sono Kazuma Kiryu."

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Kiryu-san. I really do appreciate ya goin' out of your way to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Here, take this ramen sample as a token of my gratitude.\r\n"
"It's a test sample, but it's been approved by the master.\r\n"
"So it's good as anything you'll find in the restaurant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Kyushu No. 1 Star Ramen Sample<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"Well then, Kiryu-san. It's high time I mosey on back to the\r\n"
"company and boot up the assembly line for these babies.\r\n"
"I'll send ya the finished product once it's ready to go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"He really pulled it off, huh? I'll tell ya, that kid's got\r\n"
"a lot of heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Looks like you found yourself a worthy protégé."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Indeed. Wish my son had half the spark that kid does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Never thought my logo would end up on a cup of instant\r\n"
"noodles... But you know what? I can hardly wait to see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"Now I'll have to work extra hard to keep my customers coming\r\n"
"to the restaurant instead of just buying it at the store!\r\n"
"At any rate... What'll you be having today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "You got 10,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Well, how is it!? I made sure the pork bone marrow was thoroughly simmered "
"into the broth this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"Hmm... I see. You know, for instant ramen, it's not half bad. I suppose I "
"could see it working."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "You... suppose...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"Yup. I can tell you put a lot into this. And besides, the marrow thickens "
"out the flavor, so... Yeah, I think it should be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"But... that ain't the kinda response any self-respecting chef would wanna "
"hear! I need your honest-to-goodness opinion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "It's still not worthy of Kyushu No. 1 Star... Is it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Well... I would say you did a great job in bringing out the bone marrow "
"flavor. But that signature tonkotsu taste we're known for here... Your "
"version is a slight bit overbearing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"If you can figure out how to tone that down just a notch... The ramen should"
" still have that strong kick to it, but in a way that's balanced by the "
"texture of the bone marrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"So the flavors should be complementary... All right, then I shall return "
"with a superior sample! Just you wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Hold on... Where're you running off to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"To Kyushu! I wanna learn how to make the ultimate tonkotsu\r\n"
"broth... So I'm going to the birthplace of tonkotsu ramen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"I guarantee, I'll be back with the perfect solution, and it's gonna knock "
"your socks off! Just wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Can you believe that kid? It's like he never stands still!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "So he's already put together a new sample? He sure is dedicated..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"And he was talking about you, too. Said he saw some kind of\r\n"
"vision, thanks to how you fought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "Wonder what that was... Maybe he'll add more heat this time around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "We'll just have to wait and see. Anyway, what'll you be having?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"You can't be serious! You trying to make a mockery of\r\n"
"Kyushu No. 1 Star's quality flavor!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"But check out how awesome this tastes... And how good it smells! As far as "
"instant ramen goes, it's the best it can possibly get!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"That's right. \"Instant\" being the key word here. If it were served in my "
"shop, the customers would be asking for refunds left and right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "Oh. Well... Damn, I dunno, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"Then I've got nothing else to say. This... whatever you've concocted is not "
"even close to being worthy of the Kyushu No. 1 Star brand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"Sorry you had to hear all that, sir! Must've been some sorta door-to-door "
"salesman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Anyway, please let me know whenever you're ready!"
msgstr ""

